 ## Unreleased
 
+- Prepare a Linux amd64 integration proposal with Fedora, openSUSE and AlmaLinux RPM recipes, thumbnail layout fixes and bootloader notice collection. Version 0.3.5 is a private proposal in an isolated copy, not a public platform release.
